\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces 87B operating plane. External fault + CT saturation (orange triangle) falls deep in the trip region but is restrained by the Stage-2 model-veto gate ($f_{int}=0.00$, $\kappa _n=2.7$). Internal faults (red star, grey cross) lie above the trip boundary.}}{6}{figure.caption.7}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Four-feeder 87B bus differential protection zone. Source feeder $F_0$ and three load feeders $F_1$--$F_3$; CT outputs wired to the 87B/SAMBP relay.}}{6}{figure.caption.8}%
